{
  "id": "9f64a98271a23fb3adec6883",
  "title": "减配跷脚牛肉，好好吃饭",
  "summary": "“存在即是实干。”——苏格拉底 “行动即是意义。——让·保罗·萨特 “嘟比嘟比嘟。“——弗兰克·辛纳屈 丨低配版跷脚牛肉丨 中午，我把买的牛肋条清炖了，做成了低配版本的跷脚牛肉。 正宗的跷脚牛肉汤底一般要放点中药和牛骨、牛杂一起炖煮。我没有牛骨头和牛杂呀，所以就做清汤版的跷脚牛肉，汤里只有少量的白芷。等牛肋条煮软了之后，起锅时，我加了很大一把芹菜碎末。 橘子看着汤里绿油油的碎末有点犯怵，他害怕我撒了一锅花椒叶子进去，结果一吃，发现是芹菜末，他松口气，开始开开心心将牛肋条沾着蒜泥油醋汁吃。 我说我这个狂野厨子也不至于放一大锅花椒叶子。 橘子嘿嘿笑，说：“那可不一定的啊~~” 丨很老的韭菜炒蛋丨 我刚吃了我做好的晚餐，地里割起来的韭菜太老，韭菜段吃起来颇为费劲，橘子哇哇喊着塞牙。喊完，他开始把韭菜炒蛋里的蛋一块块…",
  "content": "<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>“存在即是实干。”——苏格拉底</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>“行动即是意义。——让·保罗·萨特</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>“嘟比嘟比嘟。“——弗兰克·辛纳屈</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨低配版跷脚牛肉丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>中午，我把买的牛肋条清炖了，做成了低配版本的跷脚牛肉。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>正宗的跷脚牛肉汤底一般要放点中药和牛骨、牛杂一起炖煮。我没有牛骨头和牛杂呀，所以就做清汤版的跷脚牛肉，汤里只有少量的白芷。等牛肋条煮软了之后，起锅时，我加了很大一把芹菜碎末。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子看着汤里绿油油的碎末有点犯怵，他害怕我撒了一锅花椒叶子进去，结果一吃，发现是芹菜末，他松口气，开始开开心心将牛肋条沾着蒜泥油醋汁吃。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我说我这个狂野厨子也不至于放一大锅花椒叶子。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子嘿嘿笑，说：“那可不一定的啊~~”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨很老的韭菜炒蛋丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></p><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我刚吃了我做好的晚餐，地里割起来的韭菜太老，韭菜段吃起来颇为费劲，橘子哇哇喊着塞牙。喊完，他开始把韭菜炒蛋里的蛋一块块往我们俩碗里挑出来，让我别吃韭菜了，就吃蛋就好了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>嘿，韭菜是真的很老啊。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这细枝末节的渺小之物，就是意义本身。我此刻体验了韭菜的老，体验了橘子对彼此的关心，体验了他哇哇的喊。这一切像是细微的尘埃落在我的心灵上，带给我一些复杂综合的感受。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>琐碎本身就是其意义所在。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></div><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨炒猪舌，和芦笋煎蛋丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjGPnjn2MOJfTppfHY_e7wZ8qT0-a1Wby0LQWTi2D7PzxFcTGEJiW0SZgUwUSvi1tlp7T0Wfv7ld9jaqTzN2HlDK7wVVVd6UY4O9RHqCR9t7cxwkGci0QUThzqf3b6gXNGP_TAwOpjl_mMEry2-YGNM4YoM09vw8Ifo3A3i2Vszh7e7LuyNSMmk8npaNlyf/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260907185808_461_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjGPnjn2MOJfTppfHY_e7wZ8qT0-a1Wby0LQWTi2D7PzxFcTGEJiW0SZgUwUSvi1tlp7T0Wfv7ld9jaqTzN2HlDK7wVVVd6UY4O9RHqCR9t7cxwkGci0QUThzqf3b6gXNGP_TAwOpjl_mMEry2-YGNM4YoM09vw8Ifo3A3i2Vszh7e7LuyNSMmk8npaNlyf/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260907185808_461_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>今日，我做出了很美味的芦笋煎蛋。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>蛋，是我预先耐心一个一个</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>煎好的荷包蛋，我喜欢把荷包蛋煎得老一点，然后再把荷包蛋捞出来切成大块。随后在锅里剩下的余油里，放入洗净的芦笋段，慢慢翻炒它们，等芦笋熟透，淋两勺生抽进去，随后将切成大块的荷包蛋放进去翻炒一下。等锅里的液体都收干就可以出锅啦。</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span>橘子很喜欢这份菜，他吃了好多吃得很开心。</span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>猪舌我先用盐水煮软，我通常会煮约50分钟。用筷子捅一下猪舌，可以轻松捅穿的时候就意味着猪舌煮好了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>把煮好的猪舌捞起来，切片，随后下锅用油慢慢煎一下，猪舌的表面煎得微微发黄时，加入切好的辣椒和香菇片，翻炒片刻，淋入生抽和1勺醋，就可以出锅了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>喜欢重口味的还可以加入花椒粉和辣椒粉，一点点白糖。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>猪舌是很美味的食材，我很喜欢它的成菜。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨黄豆烧猪脚丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj5XI0JrvcySo8unPV3jglhAko5V4EbzZW4Bht52HGptz91RP5sUW4eX6Nl6pu4vpRqzhN_Y1oVQhyPKTbAeomajLWiBEWDFq06O9lEdTS6Fujiumml8tG92VCawZqXyEeTkuSS_tqOA0fjGRGEyX6UKu-z5k-AQiKACWeKsQCIDASE_oRLa0jZ5Mli6Dzn/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260909193517_469_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj5XI0JrvcySo8unPV3jglhAko5V4EbzZW4Bht52HGptz91RP5sUW4eX6Nl6pu4vpRqzhN_Y1oVQhyPKTbAeomajLWiBEWDFq06O9lEdTS6Fujiumml8tG92VCawZqXyEeTkuSS_tqOA0fjGRGEyX6UKu-z5k-AQiKACWeKsQCIDASE_oRLa0jZ5Mli6Dzn/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260909193517_469_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>洗猪脚的活儿是橘子自告奋勇干的。我洗猪蹄不大认真，橘子生怕我把带着猪毛味儿的猪脚一股脑下锅，他总是冲过来替我洗猪脚，他会把猪脚的表皮刮得干干净净，把细小的碎骨都扔掉以免吃的时候咯牙。红烧猪脚是个很简单的菜，它需要足够长的时间。成品通常都是令人满意的。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>除了红烧之外，猪蹄用来清炖大白豆也很好吃。川渝地区有不少小店卖老妈蹄花儿汤，它们的招牌菜就是大白豆炖猪脚。生意相当不错。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨食材丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4><div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span>日复一日清洗处理食材时，不由得思考，你看我们人啊，我们活着其实是建立在无数的死之上的。食物们死了，它们的物质躯体给了人类，人类通过摄取它们的死亡躯体获得能量。这是一种循环。</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span>对于我来说，珍视这份摆在我面前的食材躯体，就显得很重要。这是真诚对待生命的重要部分。</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>我现在活着，我接受了许多已经死去的生命给予我的东西。</span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span>因此，认真烹调、认真咀嚼、不轻易浪费，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>是一种朴素的敬意。</span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span>它成为我的食物，我认真地接受它。</span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span>这和传统文化里对食物的态度暗暗相通。我们没有神圣化食物，我们知道自己的生命并不是凭空发生的。既然食物已经把这一段生命交出来了，我不应该以一种漫不经心的方式对待这份给予。珍视生命，并不意味着拒绝死亡。</span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span>因为生命本来就在死亡与新生之间流动。</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>承认死亡不可避免的同时，也认真对待进入自己生命使自己继续存在的东西。</span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span>意识到这一点之后，好好吃饭突然就有了庄重感。</span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span>但下一秒，我发现黑猫坐在脚边盯着我，见我低头看向她，猫立即咪咪叫着起身带我走向她放猫条的柜子。</span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span>猫敦促我开新口味的猫条给她。上午橙色包装的猫条口味已经吃烦了，猫要求另外开一种口味，蓝色包装就很好，开它。</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span>你看，猫一点也不庄重，我还在感叹：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>“生命是死亡与新生的循环，我们应当珍视每一具进入身体的食物……”</span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><span><span><span>猫表示：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>“好的。哲学结束。换口味。”</span></span></span></span></div></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div></div></div></div><p><span><span><br></span></span></p>",
  "image": "https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjGPnjn2MOJfTppfHY_e7wZ8qT0-a1Wby0LQWTi2D7PzxFcTGEJiW0SZgUwUSvi1tlp7T0Wfv7ld9jaqTzN2HlDK7wVVVd6UY4O9RHqCR9t7cxwkGci0QUThzqf3b6gXNGP_TAwOpjl_mMEry2-YGNM4YoM09vw8Ifo3A3i2Vszh7e7LuyNSMmk8npaNlyf/s72-w482-h640-c/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20260907185808_461_20.jpg",
